<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst William Julian downgraded Sports Authority Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited company statement Monday that it expects second quarter earnings per share to be about $0.30, below analysts' consensus estimates of $0.34 a share.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off one at 18.</p>
